  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "The exact hard-level group 1 curve materializes every level used by frozen world difficulty bindings plus encounter member 103 at level 17.",
    "Bellowing Inferno deals 250% ATK Fire damage and applies two-turn stackable Enkindle at 100% base chance; each stack ticks for 50% ATK Fire damage.",
    "Blazing Absorption enters Spontaneous Combustion and advances the AI into the repeating Rain, Molten Fusion, Rain cycle.",
    "Rain of Purifying Flames performs five independently selected random hits; every hit deals 100% ATK Fire damage and applies one Enkindle stack to that same hit target.",
    "Molten Fusion adds one two-turn stack up to three stacks, with each stack contributing +30% base ATK.",
    "WeaknessBroken removes Spontaneous Combustion and Molten Fusion, then restarts Bellowing Inferno followed by Blazing Absorption before returning to Rain.",
    "The damage, DOT, stacking modifier, weak-break reset and source-ordered AI graph use shared enemy lifecycle and Rule IR without a native handler."
  ]
